      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>An enormous coil of muscle and scales is pale purple with bright blue stripes, and possesses a foot long rattle which twitches ominously at the tip.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 11, flat-footed 20 (+2 dex, +1 dodge, +12 natural, -2 size)</p><p>hp 89 (8d10+48)</p><p>Fort +11, Ref +8, Will +5</p><p>Immune poison; Resist Water 15</p><p>Weakness Ice</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft., climb 30 ft., swim 30 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +15 (3d6+12 plus poison and grab)</p><p>Space 15 ft.; Reach 15 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Constrict (3d6+12), Critical Attack, Leech</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 26, Dex 14, Con 20, Int 1, Wis 16, Cha 2</p><p>Base Atk +8; CMB +18 (+22 grapple); CMD 30 (can't be tripped)</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Initiative, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +18, Climb +20, Perception +16, Stealth +14, Swim +22; Racial Modifiers +4 Perception, +4 Stealth, +8 Acrobatics</p>"
